# #2585 item 4 (greenfield flag day): container mutations and recitations cite
# principal policies by head in `principalPolicyRefs` and no longer carry the
# full `principalPolicies` artifacts. Clients and the API deploy together on a
# fresh-data reset, so no old client sends the removed field.
# Remove these exact diagnostics once main contains this contract.
